# React / React Native (detect-on — Skip if not detected)

Flutter = `09-flutter-standards.mdc`. SPFx = `04-sharepoint-standards.mdc` (skip React web).

## Detect Priority
- `react-native` → **RN** only. `react` && !`react-native` && !SPFx → **React (web)** only. Do not mix.

## React (web) (`react` + !`react-native`)
- Surface `frontend`/`fullstack`. Semantic HTML + repo UI patterns — no invented styling lib.
- Components/hooks = repo structure; do not mix business logic into UI.
- Routing/data = existing stack (Next/React Router/TanStack Query, etc.) — if missing, Clarify-first.
- Lists/forms = key, controlled inputs, loading/error/empty.
- SEO/A11y active on web; no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without sanitize.

## React Native (`react-native`)
- Surface `mobile`. No DOM/web CSS — RN primitives (`View`/`Text`/`Pressable`/`FlatList`).
- Navigation = repo pattern (React Navigation, etc.) — no invented lib.
- Account for platform/permissions/SecureStore·Keychain iOS/Android differences.
- Lists = `FlatList`/`SectionList` (avoid `.map`+`ScrollView` for long lists).
- A11y = `accessibilityLabel`/`accessibilityRole`/touch target — no web `aria-*`/SEO HTML.
